      "content": "Wait, did you just call the bacteria \"gobbling\" cells? That's a strange choice of words. \n\nCould you please clarify what you meant by that and finish your scientific explanation? You were right in the middle of explaining how the upregulation of the pyruvate dehydrogenase complex and the PTS causes that sudden surge in acidity. I need to know if this is a purely enzymatic response or if there's a specific substrate-driven mechanism causing the domino effect you mentioned.",
